id: pm-x2aplf
title: pm config set on one leaf key rewrites settings.json with every default materialized and silently replaces explicit stored values (validation.parent_reference warn -> strict_error)
description: "Make config writes sparse and intent-preserving: changing one leaf must not materialize unrelated defaults or replace explicit stored values, reducing semantic drift and multi-branch conflict surface."
